    <briefdescription>
<para>Persistent workspace state management with corruption detection. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Provides:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>JSON-based state persistence (state.json)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Atomic write-replace semantics (write to temp, rename on success)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>SHA-256 checksum validation on load</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Fallback recovery via append-only transaction log (state.log)</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
